#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0157 expect=violation domain=ADLBC
#note "CRIT1 present, CRIT1FL absent -> first of nine disjuncts true. No lowercase marker in the names, so WildcardExpander.hasRealWildcards is false and the rule takes the NotApplicable path, executing once unexpanded. var_exists-only Check folds to dataset level -> ONE violation at reported row 1."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 nameOnly=CRIT1
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
col CRIT1   type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | 30 | AVALGT30
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | ALB | 31 | AVALGT30
